                  "description": "One streamed round per loop iteration (at most MAX_TOOL_ROUNDS + 1). app/providers/llm/openai_provider.py:61\n→ http OpenAI API (POST /v1/chat/completions)\nEvidence: app/providers/llm/openai_provider.py:61  stream = await self._client.chat.completions.create(model=self._model, messages=messages, stream=True, **extra)",
                  "showInDiagram": true,
